[{"title":"淳熙丁未初伏奉亲避暑中岩 其一","author":"杨光","text":"伽陀坐断碧岩阴，手眼无非利物心。\n借我初庚涤袢暑，泠风美荫木千寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71414,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳熙丁未初伏奉亲避暑中岩 其二","author":"杨光","text":"山下芙蕖云锦裳，宝瓶净供坐生凉。\n南薰真是社中友，清润时飘衣袂香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71415,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳熙丁未初伏奉亲避暑中岩 其三","author":"杨光","text":"禅榻阴森五月秋，井泉甘洌近林幽。\n助翁燕坐清凉境，茶具随行试一瓯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71416,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨兴宗","text":"要得一书藏石室，为缘新说自金陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71417,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书感 其二","author":"杨再十一君","text":"深湖两岸白云秋，芦荻花深隐钓舟。\n回首平原风浪急，却怜江海是安流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71418,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书感 其一","author":"杨再十一君","text":"枫江渡口草凄凄，桃浦桥边夕照低。\n惟有旧家双燕子，年年飞绕绿杨堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71419,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书感 其三","author":"杨再十一君","text":"潦倒江南一布衣，家贫岁晚寸心违。\n不堪倚杖枫江路，手种青松大十围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71420,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"杨再十一君","text":"竹窗吹雨夜潇潇，独拥寒炉叹寂寥。\n坐久不知更漏永，镫花零落篆香消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71421,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"杨再十一君","text":"张良大父父，相韩五世君。\n报仇误一击，佐命筹三军。\n灭秦复诛项，兴汉称元勋。\n始终心为韩，义烈千载闻。\n吾家世臣宋，绂冕兴如云。\n于今虽为庶，义不忘宋恩。\n国亡幸免死，忍复干禄云。\n耻为肤敏士，宁作殷顽民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71422,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜迁莺","author":"杨再可","text":"腊天初晓，庆五色瑞云，华轩呈绕。\n紫府真人，丹台仙伯，合降世间荣耀。\n彩笔素题，篇翰未减，家声词藻。\n秀眉宇，俊丰标阀阅，声名都好。\n富贵长欢笑。\n此际锦堂，移下蓬莱岛。\n妙舞蹁跹，清歌宛转，两行翠娥燕赵。\n劝饮百千钟酒，岁岁朱颜不老。\n春近也，看香红又怕，小桃开了。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71423,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨存","text":"月中丹桂输先手，镜里朱颜正后生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71424,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八声甘州 寿萧帅参九月廿三","author":"杨守","text":"问梅边消息有还无，似微笑应人。\n道近来别有，相家一种，叶叶都新。\n趁得嫩寒轻暖，七日小阳春。\n一点和羹意，来做生辰。\n锦绣香中开国，向绮霞洞里，暂寄闲身。\n欠朝家多少，未了底经纶。\n便如何、偷闲去得，也须烦、妙手略调钧。\n归来也，恨寻棋局，点检园椿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71425,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白帝庙","author":"杨安诚","text":"蜀江万壑俱东奔，瞿唐喧豗争一门。\n惊涛骇浪建瓴下，颠崖仆谷相吐吞。\n朋妖窟宅恃幽阻，正昼喷薄阴霾昏。\n灵宫奕奕镇地险，众渎禀令川祇尊。\n赤甲后耸黄熊跃，滟滪前峙青猿蹲。\n舳舻衔尾下吴楚，约束蛟鳄如鸡豚。\n旧传鼓角致雨雹，裹篙不触撑舟痕。\n综理脉络尽西徼，帝假之柄攸司存。\n子阳祚国十年近，此地未省东其辕。\n联江列炬铁锁断，戎满奔北无留屯。\n江关回首尽汉帜，遗黎何自知公孙。\n血食汉代定不尔，但有故垒山之樊。\n子美误信齐东语，感慨勇略招英魂。\n山川之灵载望秩，僭伪讵可同时论。\n向来名实久淆溷，荐祼无乃渎俎膰。\n请从郦元为考證，神理昭昭斯可原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71426,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨安诚","text":"扶摇天一握，培塿蜀千山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71427,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 其二","author":"杨师纯","text":"小庭春院。\n睡起花阴转。\n往事旧欢离思远。\n柳絮随风难管。\n等闲屈指当时。\n阑干几曲谁知。\n为问春风桃李，而今子满芳枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 其一","author":"杨师纯","text":"羞蛾浅浅。\n秋水如刀剪。\n窗下无人自针线。\n不觉郎来身畔。\n相将携手鸳帏。\n匆匆不许多时。\n耳畔告郎低语，共郎莫使人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范公希文怀庆朔堂","author":"杨异","text":"日将先圣诗书教，暂作文翁守郁林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"杨朴","text":"未会牵牛意若何，须邀织女弄金梭。\n年年乞与人间巧，不道人间巧已多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上陈文惠","author":"杨朴","text":"昨夜西风烂漫秋，今朝东岸独垂钩。\n紫袍不识蓑衣客，曾对君王十二旒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居感兴","author":"杨朴","text":"一壶村酒胶牙酸，十数胡皴彻骨乾。\n随著四婆裙子后，杖头挑去赛蚕官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"杨朴","text":"更无落魄耽杯酒，更莫猖狂爱咏诗。\n今日捉将官里去，这回断送老头皮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日闲居","author":"杨朴","text":"忽闻高柳噪新蝉，厌暑情怀顿豁然。\n庭槛夜凉风撼竹，池塘香散水摇莲。\n鲈鱼鲙忆奔江浦，焦尾琴思换蜀弦。\n莫遣金樽空对月，满斟高唱混流年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莎衣","author":"杨朴","text":"软绿柔蓝著胜衣，倚船吟钓正相宜。\n蒹葭影里和烟卧，菡萏香中带雨披。\n狂脱酒家春醉后，乱堆渔舍晚晴时。\n直饶紫绶金章贵，未肯轻轻博换伊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨朴","text":"就客饮时担酒去，见鱼游处拨萍开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"杨权","text":"七十九年梦觉，五湖四海随缘。\n拨转云头归去，晓日东升赤然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿龙头","author":"杨汝南","text":"江流如箭路如梯，夜泊龙头烟霭迷。\n两角孤云天一握，晓光不觉玉绳低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九锁","author":"杨迈","text":"寻幽向何处，大涤山水好。\n九峰拔奇秀，下有松石老。\n白云和红叶，满径无人扫。\n振衣长风生，一笑登木杪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王信伯先生 其一","author":"杨邦弼","text":"伊洛亲闻道，渊微赖发扬。\n东吴贤望重，西观旧书藏。\n吾党将安放，斯文岂遂亡。\n堂堂宁复见，门士恸新冈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王信伯先生 其二","author":"杨邦弼","text":"梁木俄摧坏，嗟吁丧大贤。\n典刑看肖子，道学付谁传。\n一代风流尽，千年物论先。\n师言犹在耳，身敢坠周旋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九锁 其一","author":"杨伯岩","text":"晓山云树碧生秋，乘兴间为洞府游。\n片石却将仙路隔，负人平昔慕浮丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徐偃王庙","author":"杨伯岩","text":"当年大德瑞朱弓，仁在斯民千古同。\n故国已无徐子土，灵祠今有梵王宫。\n水流檐影晴江上，山接钟声暮霭中。\n揽辔此行因致敬，蒲团分坐听谈空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九锁 其二","author":"杨伯岩","text":"亭前绝壁下飞瀑，天风夜半吹韶咸。\n疑是银河天上水，壮士挽落千丈岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏莎行 雪中疏寮借阁帖，更以薇露送之","author":"杨伯岩","text":"梅观初花，蕙庭残叶。\n当时惯听山阴雪。\n东风吹梦到清都，今年雪比年前别。\n重酿宫醪，双钩官帖。\n伴翁一笑成三绝。\n夜深何用对青藜，窗前一片蓬莱月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨伯岩","text":"东台仙子许参元，满月光明现大千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三仙祠","author":"杨佐","text":"胜迹传来不记年，昔闻尝驻汉神仙。\n碑因藓蚀无完字，址为藤迷失旧阡。\n岩屋镫悬松外月，石炉香散竹间烟。\n翻思谷穗遗人日，陈迹寥寥一惘然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一剪梅","author":"杨佥判","text":"襄樊四载弄干戈。\n不见渔歌，不见樵歌。\n试问如今事若何，金也消磨，谷也消磨。\n柘枝不用舞婆娑。\n丑也能多，恶也能多。\n朱门日日买朱娥，军事如何，民事如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵攀和通判员外题金泉观之作","author":"杨克让","text":"冲虚脱屣世绵绵，胜地人来尚凛然。\n不见綵云迎皓鹤，空留怪石漱清泉。\n侵阶蔓草迷香径，偃盖寒松杂暮烟。\n静化信从无妄得，堪思汉武亦神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳日兴庆池禊宴","author":"杨初平","text":"照坐壶冰寒凛凛，北斗挥浆均祓饮。\n兴庆池头春色浓，乱柳摇金花罩锦。\n雕章丽藻俱时才，落笔颂歌两两台。\n府公莫惜玉山醉，明日天纶凤诏来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 亚献","author":"杨均","text":"当年宋壁。\n血拥河流赤。\n全护东南形胜，百易万、五神力。\n人心同奋激。\n立此生民极。\n哀角载歌霜晓，琼□、圣容怿。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 终献","author":"杨均","text":"忠忱谊愊。\n对越如丹赤。\n缅想遗风馀烈，犹身见、古颜色。\n惟馨非黍稷。\n穆穆歆明德。\n簟滟芳彝须醉，回云旞、佑乡国。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 祭双庙乐章 初献","author":"杨均","text":"丹楹转月。\n金绣纷幢钺。\n勋在有唐宗社，人千载、仰英烈。\n维辰嗟尽节。\n故里昭虔揭。\n临御雍雍来下，歆初荐、俎羞洁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"杨岛仙","text":"待得团圆时候，樽前问这时节。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷","author":"杨希古","text":"万壑千岩叠翠微，幔亭红日浸涟漪。\n紫阳去后无消息，留得溪山九曲诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绮川亭","author":"杨志","text":"一泓绿净沧浪水，千朵红稠菡萏花。\n病眼纷纷何所似，江天落日散馀霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼓楼怀古","author":"杨志","text":"兴废何年事，无由问老成。\n代为兜率地，留得古楼名。\n石塔添潮影，铜壶断漏声。\n我来空吊古，恨不赋芜城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石涧龙首山","author":"杨志","text":"残年仍置闰，五日恰逢春。\n携酒各独赏，敲门僧不嗔。\n双榕如拱立，万井故横陈。\n僧舍少盘薄，元规尘上人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久旱","author":"杨时","text":"农郊阡陌起黄尘，望断天涯绝点云。\n疏懒无情讼风伯，幽窗时读退之文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"杨时","text":"敝裘千里北风寒，还忆箪瓢陋巷安。\n位重金多非所慕，直缘三釜慰亲欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东林道上閒步三首 其三","author":"杨时","text":"碧眼庞眉老比丘，云根高卧语难酬。\n萧然丈室无人问，一炷炉峰顶上浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东林道上閒步三首 其二","author":"杨时","text":"百年陈迹水溶溶，尚忆高人寄此中。\n晋代衣冠谁复在，虎溪长有白莲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东林道上閒步三首 其一","author":"杨时","text":"寂寞莲塘七百秋，溪云庭月两悠悠。\n我来欲问林间道，万叠松声自唱酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出郊","author":"杨时","text":"云根修蔓绿成阴，风雨园林懒重寻。\n春日去来人不问，碧桃朱李付幽禽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出尉氏","author":"杨时","text":"隔林残雪弄轻风，日射晴光玉缕红。\n桃杏浑如梅欲绽，直疑身在故园中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白公草堂","author":"杨时","text":"炉峰袅袅晓烟轻，云入屏帏一枕清。\n高兴自应无世累，独于妾马未忘情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安礼以宏词见勉因成绝句奉寄","author":"杨时","text":"万钟身外一牛毛，斗禄纷纷漫自劳。\n穷涸宁为猵獭笑，未容仰首试鸣号。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安西闻捷 其一","author":"杨时","text":"鹰扬塞外得非熊，万里金城一箭通。\n玉帐投壶随燕豆，坐看飞将缚骁戎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安西闻捷 其三","author":"杨时","text":"雅歌不待来天马，谢质今应闭玉门。\n早勒勋名上彝鼎，放回春色满乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安西闻捷 其二","author":"杨时","text":"将军新拥节旄閒，紫塞云浮豹尾班。\n白首边城休怅望，马蹄未出玉门关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上","author":"杨时","text":"寒云幕羃结秋阴，月淡霜娥冷不禁。\n更祝江波休荡漾，莫令清影碎浮金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过七里濑 其一","author":"杨时","text":"拂云高雁倚风抟，下视平湖万里宽。\n搔首扁舟又东去，钱塘江上看波澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过七里濑 其二","author":"杨时","text":"扁舟东下几时还，一席飞帆插羽翰。\n回首严陵台上月，清风千古逼人寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过丰城","author":"杨时","text":"清江渺渺绿浮天，博物无人继昔贤。\n应有斗间灵气在，谁能更与斸龙泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过兰溪","author":"杨时","text":"纷纷朝市竞秋毫，江上霜风正怒号。\n不问扬澜与彭浪，翩然东下日千艘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过石首谒县官回有作","author":"杨时","text":"万事纷纷醉即休，无功可作酒泉侯。\n谁能载取千缸去，且向舟中打拍浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过庐山遇雨","author":"杨时","text":"江风吹雨逐人来，行过山前首重回。\n绝顶隔云看不见，石棱崖角独崔嵬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县斋书事 其一","author":"杨时","text":"簿书投老岂身谋，朱墨纷纷晚即休。\n平世功名归稷禹，一瓢吾欲慕巢由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县斋书事 其二","author":"杨时","text":"一去人间二十年，空馀飞雪上华颠。\n清时最有求田乐，未愧陈登榻上眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含云寺书事 其一","author":"杨时","text":"兽骇禽鸣翳蔚中，难将此意问鸿蒙。\n萦回小径苍苔滑，杖屦从今恐不通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含云寺书事 其三","author":"杨时","text":"蝶梦轻扬一室空，梦回谁识此身同。\n窗前月冷松阴碎，一枕溪声半夜风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含云寺书事三首 其三","author":"张载","text":"竹间幽径草成围，藜杖穿云翠满衣。\n石上坐忘惊觉晚，山前明月伴人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含云寺书事三首 其二","author":"张载","text":"夹屋青松长数围，午风摇影舞僛僛。\n幽禽叶底鸣相应，时引残声过别枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含云寺书事 其二","author":"杨时","text":"北山山下一渔翁，形解心凝骨已融。\n支枕睡馀人寂寂，一轩明月满窗风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71485,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴国华暗香亭","author":"杨时","text":"漫愁青女妒新妆，已有风传处处香。\n试问隐沦溪上客，欲将春色若为藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71486,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲居书事","author":"张载","text":"轻风拂拂撼孤柽，庭户萧然一室清。\n隔叶蝉鸣微欲断，又闻馀韵续残声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":71487,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]